#: rc.cpp:52
msgid ""
"The format of the page may be set to a standard format like DIN A4 or "
"Letter. To set custom values for the page size, please choose \"Custom\" and "
"enter the values below."
msgstr ""
"Die formaat van Die bladsy dalk mag wees stel na 'n standaard formaat hou "
"van Din A4 of Brief. na stel pasmaak waardes vir Die bladsy grootte, "
"asseblief kies \"pasmaak\" en invoer Die waardes onder."

#: rc.cpp:53
msgid "&Format:"
msgstr "Formaat:"

#: rc.cpp:54
msgid ""
"This box contains the width of the page. As soon as you change the "
"formatting to Custom you are able to change this value."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie boks bevat die wydte van die bladsy. as binnekort as jy verander die "
"formatering na Pasmaak jy word in staat na verander Hierdie waarde."

#: rc.cpp:55
msgid ""
"This box contains the height of the page. As soon as you change the "
"formatting to Custom you are able to change this value."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie boks bevat die hoogte van die bladsy. as binnekort as jy verander "
"die formatering na Pasmaak jy word in staat na verander Hierdie waarde."

