#: rc.cpp:66
msgid "You can enter the size of the bottom border here."
msgstr "Jy kan invoer die grootte van die bodem grens hier."

#: rc.cpp:67
msgid "Restore &Default Settings"
msgstr "Herstel Verstek Instellings"

#: rc.cpp:68
msgid "This button will restore the default settings for the page layout."
msgstr "Hierdie knoppie sal herstel die verstek instellings vir die bladsy uitleg."

#: rc.cpp:69
msgid "&Save as Default Settings"
msgstr "Stoor as Verstek Instellings"

#: rc.cpp:70
msgid ""
"This button will save the current settings as your preferred default "
"settings. These default settings are loaded every time you start this "
"application."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie knoppie sal stoor die huidige instellings as jou verkies verstek "
"instellings. Hierdie verstek instellings word gelaai elke tyd jy begin "
"Hierdie aansoek."

